DE,Blocktoberfest Art Competition
DS,Muttlee
SP,/var/www/private/onair/artfax/p400.tti
CT,8,T
PN,40000
SC,0000
PS,8000
OL,0,XXXXXXXXARTFAX mpp DAY dd MTH C hh:nn.ss
OL,1,D]MCBlocktoberfest 2026                 
OL,2,                                        
OL,3,                                        
OL,4,FBlocktoberfest Art Competition         
OL,5,                                        
OL,6,FThe competition entries can be viewed  
OL,7,Ffrom page 401 onwards.                 
OL,8,                                        
OL,9,FThe three categories are:              
OL,10,MChunk Award.....Capture the essence    
OL,11,                                        
OL,12,CCapture the retro feel of the medium   
OL,13,MThe Next Level..Technical excellence   
OL,14,                                        
OL,15,CThe next level is 2.5, obviously       
OL,16,MAnalog Hero.....Look mum, no computer  
OL,17,                                        
OL,18,CNo excuses. Anyone can draw on paper   
OL,19,                                        
OL,20,Fand an overall category:               
OL,21,MBest Overall....Elite skillz           
OL,22,                                        
OL,23,CWhat impresses the judge the most      
OL,24,A Next   B....       C....      FHelp   
